<p style="padding:5px 0 0 55px;font:14px Verdana;color:#525252;line-height:22px;width:250px;">Lady Goodiva has been in business for many decades now. We are proud to have such high class escorts working with us and making our clients lives better than ever. We hire on specific terms and have specific requirements for our escorts, most importantly understanding that clients always come first. We are always looking to hire new ladies who want to work with has and make the world a better pleasure to live in. We have the most experience, and if you don’t believe us, give us a try. </p></div>



